    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Trigger </strong>You are about to cast a spell and it would apply to the requirements or triggers for two different catalysts or catalyze actions.</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You can use an ephemeral catalyst to combine two catalysts to create dangerous effects on your spellcraft. Your catalyzed spell adds the benefits of both catalysts or catalyze actions that meet the trigger. If both catalysts or catalyze actions requires you to add actions to Activate, this action gains the Catalyze 2 trait.</p>"
